pulist parties in Europe: addressing the globalization cleavage |first1=Andrés |last1=Santana |first2=José |last2=Rama |year=2018 |journal=European Politics and Society |doi=10.1080/23745118.2018.1482848 |volume=19 |issue=5 |url=https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/23745118.2018.1482848 |publisher=Taylor & Francis |page=13 |quote="Finally, although some authors posit that KKE in Greece has assumed a populist discourse, for others, the KKE is a communist party with a clear Leninist-Marxist discourse."|url-access=subscription }}|{{cite journal |url=https://hrcak.srce.hr/clanak/394167 |title=After the Storm: Party Systems in Southern Europe in the Wake of the Eurocrisis |journal=Suvremeni Mediteran |volume=1 |issue=1 |year=2022 |first=Višeslav |last=Raos |doi=10.17818/SM/2021/1.2 |via=[[:hr:Hrčak (portal)|Hrčak]] |page=28 |quote="The rather unusual far-right outliers for the Greek party system in the 2000s pertain to the Greek Communist Party (KKE), an orthodox Marxist-Leninist party with underpinnings of social conservatism."|doi-access=free }}}}</ref><br />[[Anti-revisionism]]<br>[[Hard Euroscepticism]]{{refn|<ref name="auto"/><ref>{{cite book |title=Crisis Elections, New Contenders and Government Formation: Breaking the Mould in Southern Europe |editor1=Anna Bosco |editor2=Susannah Verney |isbn=978-1-138-57243-0 |year=2018 |publisher=Taylor & Francis |chapter=SYRIZA’s Electoral Rise in Greece: Protest, Trust and the Art of Political Manipulation |first=Myrto |last=Tsakatika |page=215 |quote="SYRIZA could be argued to have been in a better position than both the hard eurosceptic KKE and the ‘uncritically’ pro-European DIMAR and The River to benefit from this upsurge."}}</ref><ref>{{cite thesis |title=O marxismo-leninismo e a crise económica e financeira de 2008: oportunidades e desafios em análise |url=https://repositorium.sdum.uminho.pt/bitstream/1822/61136/1/Jose_%2BPedro%2BMartins%2BLopes.pdf |language=pt |first=José Pedro |last=Martins Lopes |publisher=Universidade do Minho |degree=Mestrado em Ciência Política |page=11 |date=April 2019 |quote="O autor demonstra que a maioria dos PER são soft eurosceptics (por exemplo, Partido Comunista Espanhol, Die Linke e Rifondazione); contudo, comprova também a existência hard eurosceptics (por exemplo, KKE e PCP)." |trans-quote="The author demonstrates that most PERs are soft Eurosceptics (e.g., Spanish Communist Party, Die Linke, and Rifondazione); however, he also proves the existence of hard Eurosceptics (e.g., KKE and PCP)."}}</ref>}}<br>}}
