'''Maria Syrengela''' ({{langx|el|Μαρία Συρεγγέλα}}; born 25 December 1975) is a Greek politician serving as a member of the [[Hellenic Parliament]] since 2023.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hellenicparliament.gr/Vouleftes/Viografika-Stoicheia/?MPId=e708afe1-5768-43ed-bb96-b01900da96c6|title=Μαρία Κωνσταντίνου Συρεγγέλα|publisher=[[Hellenic Parliament]]|language=el}}</ref> She concurrently serves as secretary of [[New Democracy (Greece)|New Democracy]] since 2023,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.tovima.gr/2023/11/20/politics/maria-syreggela-poia-einai-i-proti-gynaika-grammateas-tis-nd/|title=Μαρία Συρεγγέλα: Ποια είναι η πρώτη γυναίκα γραμματέας της ΝΔ|work=[[To Vima]]|date=20 November 2023|language=el}}</ref> and as a member of the [[Parliamentary Assembly of the Council of Europe]] since 2023.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://pace.coe.int/en/members/8840/syrengela|title=Ms Maria Syrengela (Greece, EPP/CD)|publisher=[[Parliamentary Assembly of the Council of Europe]]}}</ref>

