The '''Democratic Patriotic Popular Movement "Niki" ''' ({{Langx|el|Δημοκρατικό Πατριωτικό Λαϊκό Κίνημα «Νίκη»|translit=Dimokratikó Patriotikó Laikó Kínima “Níki”}}),<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-21 |title=Εκλογές 2023: Τα 36 κόμματα που διεκδικούν την ψήφο μας |url=https://www.naftemporiki.gr/politics/1473715/ekloges-2023-ta-36-kommata-poy-diekdikoyn-tin-psifo-mas/ |access-date=2023-06-24 |website=www.naftemporiki.gr |language=el}}</ref> often shortened to simply '''Niki''' ({{Literal translation|Victory}}), is a [[Far-right politics|far-right]] [[List of political parties in Greece|political party in Greece]]. It was founded by [[Teacher|educator]] [[Dimitris Natsios]] in 2019.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-18 |title=Εκλογές 2023: Δημήτρης Νατσιός, ο θεολόγος που έβαλε τη «Νίκη» στον εκλογικό χάρτη |url=https://www.protothema.gr/politics/article/1371070/ekloges-2023-dimitris-natsios-o-theologos-pou-evale-ti-niki-ston-eklogiko-harti/ |access-date=2023-06-24 |website=ProtoThema |language=el}}</ref> In the parliamentary elections of June 2023, the party received a percentage of 3.70%, electing 10 deputies to the [[Hellenic Parliament]] in which today, it forms the 7th Parliamentary Group.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-21 |title=Αποτελέσματα εκλογών 2023 {{!}} Η ΝΑΥΤΕΜΠΟΡΙΚΗ |url=https://www.naftemporiki.gr/ekloges-2023/ |access-date=2024-06-09 |website=www.naftemporiki.gr |language=el}}</ref>

Its main programmatic positions are defined as, "Faith, Fatherland, Family",<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-18 |title=Εκλογές 2023: Δημήτρης Νατσιός, ο θεολόγος που έβαλε τη «Νίκη» στον εκλογικό χάρτη |url=https://www.protothema.gr/politics/article/1371070/ekloges-2023-dimitris-natsios-o-theologos-pou-evale-ti-niki-ston-eklogiko-harti/ |access-date=2024-07-09 |website=ProtoThema |language=el}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Νίκη: η επιστροφή του τριπτύχου Πατρίς-Θρησκεία-Οικογένεια με μια παραλλαγή |date=21 August 2023 |url=https://www.efsyn.gr/stiles/apopseis/401456_niki-i-epistrofi-toy-triptyhoy-patris-thriskeia-oikogeneia-me-mia-parallagi}}</ref> the radical restructuring of education in [[School|Greek schools]],<ref>{{Cite web |title=ΝΙΚΗ - Νατσιός: Θα πολεμήσουμε για το τρίπτυχο Πίστη, Πατρίδα, Οικογένεια |url=https://www.voria.gr/article/d-natsios-tha-polemisoyme-gia-triptyho-pisti-patrida-oikogeneia}}</ref> changing [[Greek nationality law]] in regards to immigrants and refugees and the adoption of measures to solve the [[Demography|demographic problem]],<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-09-13 |title=Demographic decline: Greece faces alarming population collapse |url=https://www.euronews.com/2024/09/13/demographic-decline-greece-faces-alarming-population-collapse |access-date=2024-10-02 |website=euronews |language=en}}</ref> such as supporting large families and the [[Nuclear family|traditional family]].<ref>{{Cite web | date=2023-05-22 |title=ΝΙΚΗ: Ποιο είναι το κόμμα που για λίγες ψήφους δεν μπήκε στη Βουλή |url=https://www.cnn.gr/politiki/story/364341/niki-poio-einai-to-komma-pou-gia-liges-psifous-den-bike-sti-vouli |access-date=2024-07-09 |website=CNN.gr |language=el}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-05-18 |title=Εκλογές 2023: Δημήτρης Νατσιός, ο θεολόγος που έβαλε τη «Νίκη» στον εκλογικό χάρτη |url=https://www.protothema.gr/politics/article/1371070/ekloges-2023-dimitris-natsios-o-theologos-pou-evale-ti-niki-ston-eklogiko-harti/ |access-date=2024-07-09 |website=ProtoThema |language=el}}</ref> The party is supportive of the [[Greek Orthodox Church]] and has been described as "ultra-religious".<ref>{{Cite journal |last=Tsirbas |first=Yannis |date=2023-04-03 |title=Towards a predominant party system: the May 2023 election in Greece |url=https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/13608746.2024.2320518 |journal=South European Society and Politics |language=en |volume=28 |issue=2 |pages=207–230 |doi=10.1080/13608746.2024.2320518 |issn=1360-8746|url-access=subscription}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-07-04 |title=In the most recent election, Greek far right made a sinister comeback |url=https://www.euronews.com/2023/07/04/in-the-most-recent-election-greek-far-right-made-a-sinister-comeback |access-date=2024-08-28 |website=euronews |language=en}}</ref>
